From ca772ed93fea87bc00ef6b0bd77078ce4576a11e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HempFiend <17104973+jaidenscool1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:55:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] Black Ops II PS4 (title 2430): auth3 HTTPS sign-in,
 bandwidth test, files by title

- Title::T6Ps4 = 2430; DW_AUTH3_ADDR serves the PS4 HTTPS sign-in (/auth/, self-made cert).
- Bandwidth test (service 18) answered for T6 like MW2 (shared bandwidth_test_reply), so hosts open public slots.
- User files are read per title: PS3 and PS4 player ids overlap, so the PS4 game got the PS3 stats file.
- Stats check only for PS3; matchmaking logs search parameters.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
